Subject: [PATCH] fix(parser): Don't report conflicting arguments in usage

Fixes #6236
---
 tests/builder/groups.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tests/builder/groups.rs b/tests/builder/groups.rs
index 1bc7945c..a79d2661 100644
--- a/tests/builder/groups.rs
+++ b/tests/builder/groups.rs
@@ -232,7 +232,7 @@ error: the argument '--conflict' cannot be used with:
   --a
   --b
 
-Usage: prog --a --conflict
+Usage: prog --conflict
 
 For more information, try '--help'.
 
